# Route JSONs for the `inway` instance (north-south traffic entering PodiumD).
#
# Empty in the chart on purpose: what the inway fronts is per-environment — the
# route needs the environment's public hostname in its `host` match and its own
# upstream Service. Environments seed `inbound-<app>.json` files deploy-side
# against this instance's Admin API.
#
# See charts/podiumd/docs/apps/frankgateway/frankgateway-traffic-classes.md.
